---
routeKey: faq
title: "Häufige Fragen zu Preis, Ablauf und Betrieb | DIWEBA"
description: "Alle Antworten zu Preis, Cookie-Banner, Vertragsbindung, Eigentum an der Website und was mit einer bestehenden Seite passiert — neun ehrliche Antworten."
---
{#
  /faq/ — the complete 9-item list, ported from src/_data/faq.js (a direct
  port of DIWEBA/diweba-site.js's `faq.items`). Not part of the design's own
  navigation (the design never had a dedicated FAQ page — see faq.js and
  processPage.js headers), but a real, linkable page the homepage and
  process page both point to.
#}
{%- set t = ui[lang] -%}
{%- set f = faq[lang] -%}
{#- No separate approved eyebrow/H1 pair exists for a standalone FAQ page
    (the design never had one) -- f.label serves both roles, matching how
    the homepage's own Why/Process/FAQ sections already reuse one label as
    both the small eyebrow tag and the section heading. Nothing invented. -#}
{%- set heroEyebrow = f.label -%}
{%- set heroH1 = f.label -%}
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}

<section class="row row--no-border">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(21.25rem, 1fr));gap:var(--space-lg) clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 4rem)">
      {%- for item in f.items %}
      <div class="faq-entry">
        <h2 class="faq-entry__q" style="font-size:var(--text-xl)">{{ item.q }}</h2>
        <p class="faq-entry__a">{{ item.a }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="row row--edge-top row--no-border">
  <div class="container cluster" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
    <div class="stack" style="gap:8px">
      <h2 style="font-size:var(--text-3xl);max-width:20em">{{ home.de.finalH }}</h2>
      <p class="text-soft" style="font-size:var(--text-base)">{{ home.de.finalSub }}</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ "contact" | route(lang) }}">{{ t.ctaPrimary }}</a>
  </div>
</section>
